 or spoken conversations about past experiences."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Present"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Present tense to ask and say what you do at a job."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Statements\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you do here?</span></br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do I do today?</span><br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you usually work online?</span></br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I work on websites.</br> I don't know who to work with first.</br> Yes. I create computer  graphics.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: What do you do here?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Anne</span>: I work on websites.</span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to show around "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take someone through a place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Silvia, are you free to show Peter around the office?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear at a new job."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "website"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a place for information on the internet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our website address is www.mechatech.com."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "c