omething different.</br></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Dan</span>: What are you doing now? <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Erica</span>: I'm going to a meeting. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le06ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Research a job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find out what people do at this job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph, 25 - 30 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write about the job, and explain what the person does every day."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify what people do at different jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe a job in complete statements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use action words to explain what people do at at work every day."}]}], "type": "sena"}